languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\">\\(\\sqcup\\)</span> 是固定空白字符；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},k)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},k)\\)</span> 是候选八元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 和其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\">\\(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\\)</span> 是下述重排及插入空白字符的映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.6}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm{multi}}(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},k)\n\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.6}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm{multi}}(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},k)\n\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{multi}}\\coloneqq\n\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},k):\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(\\operatorname{lift}_{\\mathrm{multi}}(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},k))\\}\"><div 